ctions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47996, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GMoiGYuVJRCgUcxniYa1Ga", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49939, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KN96W8J3rWGdgGbmmEFaPB", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50239, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KN96W8J3rWGdgGbmmEFaPB", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50239, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KN96W8J3rWGdgGbmmEFaPB", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54234, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the service is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. The release history marks both v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) as unhealthy. The most recent healthy release was v2.3.0.\n2. **Rollback:** checkout-api now runs v2.3.0 in all three regions. A follow-up check shows it healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** INC-0001 describes what failed, the rollback, the current status, and the next step: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 problem before redeploying it. The first request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't make a second one and page on-call twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WXKXzX2WAUi5WywJeiodVu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-ap